_rxn--sn-e-k014","sectionId":"organic_rxn/sn-e","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"E2: anti-periplanar, 강염기.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--sn-e-k015","sectionId":"organic_rxn/sn-e","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"3차 alkyl halide는 일반적인 SN2가 입체적으로 불리하다.","kind":"highlight","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]},{"id":"organic_rxn--sn-e-k016","sectionId":"organic_rxn/sn-e","unitId":"organic_rxn","subject":"chemistry","text":"일반적으로 SN2가 유리하다.","kind":"review-answer","scope":"current-scope-candidate","verificationStatus":"draft-not-independently-verified","referenceIds":["organic10"]}]}